note bottom of applications
  Recruitment status: APPLIED -> UNDER_REVIEW -> SHORTLISTED
  -> INTERVIEW -> OFFER -> HIRED, with REJECTED / WITHDRAWN exits.
  Eligible forward skips and corrections follow the Application contract.
  INTERVIEW is an Application status only in this scoped proposal.
  Record each change in application_status_history with actor and time.
  Interview scheduling, slots and Interview response records are excluded.
  Offer and Hiring Confirmation records retain their separate prerequisites.
end note
